 courses are likely to be both asynchronous and synchronous.  All online J.D. program faculty and staff will fulfill their responsibilities in person at OCU Law. Clinical Instructor or Clinical Assistant Professor of Nursing Nursing School The Kramer School of Nursing at Oklahoma City University invites applications for a 12-month, non-tenure track Clinical Instructor or Clinical Assistant Professor of Nursing position. The successful candidate will begin as soon as possible. Recruitment Specialist Human Resources Oklahoma City University is seeking an organized, service-minded Recruitment Specialist to coordinate hiring across our campus community, from the first job posting to the new hire's first day. This role is ideal for an HR professional who thrives on process, is ready for ownership of a function, and understands that every search reflects the institution. Preventative Maintenance Program Specialist Facilities This position is responsible for the day-to-day maintenance operations of the HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and mechanical systems for the university. Ready to Apply? First Name (required) de0a39cf Last Name (required) dbae43fa Email (required) 80758c92 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Equal Employment Opportunity Oklahoma City University pledges to recruit, select, and promote diversity by providing equality of opportunity in higher education for all current and prospective students, faculty, and staff with respect to hiring, continuation, promotion and tenure, and applications for admission or employment, without discrimination or segregation based on sex (gender), race, age, ancestry, color, disability, genetic history, national origin, marital status, medical condition, religious creed, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, pregnancy, parenting status, status as a veteran, or the perception that a person has one or more of these characteristics. For questions, concerns, and/or additional information, p